flowchart LR
  O[Course aim + four learning outcomes] --> M[Five reviewed modules]
  M --> L[Learn]
  L --> T[Try: real FarmPi interaction]
  T --> A[Ask: one bounded conversation]
  A --> C[Check: lightweight reflection]
  C --> N[Continue: recommended next module or free navigation]
  N --> M
  T -->|matching returned intent| P[Device-local Try/check/module progress]
  A -->|validated module id only| R[Reviewed module context + provenance]
  R --> E[Evidence-aware explanation]
  E --> C
